+            # (check_cxx_source_compiles may pass while actual ggml build fails).
+            # M4 Macs fall back to apple_m2_m3 (DOTPROD + MATMUL_INT8) with
+            # negligible performance difference.
+            # See: GitHub CI macOS-14 runner (M1, Xcode 15.4/16.x) fails with
+            # "'svexpa_f32' needs target feature sve" when apple_m4 is enabled.
